# 🔐 SOC Analyst Connection

Linux knowledge is essential for investigating compromised systems.

For example:

```text
Security Alert
      ↓
Identify affected Linux machine
      ↓
Check logged-in users
      ↓
whoami / id
      ↓
Investigate processes
      ↓
ps / top
      ↓
Check suspicious services
      ↓
systemctl
      ↓
Check files and permissions
      ↓
ls -l
      ↓
Investigate environment
      ↓
Environment variables
```

A suspicious process running with **root privileges**, an unexpected service, or an executable with unusual permissions can be important investigation leads.

